          "description": {
            "content": "### Get Recommendations\n\nThis endpoint retrieves a list of recommendations based on the customer ID and a specified limit.\n\n#### Request Parameters\n\n- `customerId` (string, required): The unique identifier of the customer.\n    \n- `limit` (number, optional): The maximum number of recommendations to be returned (default is 10).\n    \n- `aiFeatures` (string, optional): Additional features for AI recommendation.\n    \n\n#### Response\n\nThe response for this request is an array of objects with the following JSON schema:\n\n``` javascript\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"\",\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"generatedDescription\": \"\",\n    \"userRating\": \"\",\n    \"sentimentAnalysis\": \"\",\n    \"topReviews\": [\"\"]\n  }\n]\n\n ```",
